d8b591291d19a53147c904fe2a\n> - Date (UTC): 2026-11-10T12:58:00Z\n> \n\n> **@github-actions[bot]** (2026-11-11T15:05:47Z)\n>\n> The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n> \n> - Failing job: `release`\n> - Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/43009665440\n> - Commit: 9387ee3e18fb19f8bc8aa2143692736fc7f7fe6c\n> - Date (UTC): 2026-11-11T15:05:45Z\n> \n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-11-24T18:49:21Z)\n>\n> Closing with evidence: the last failure reported here is from 2026-11-11. Since then the scheduled Daily Release has been green; the four newest runs on main all succeeded, the newest being [run 45408530296](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/45408530296) on 2026-11-24. A release newer than this issue is published: [v2026.11.22](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/releases/tag/v2026.11.22) (2026-11-22), and npm `latest` is 2026.11.22. The workflow reopens or refiles this issue if a release job fails again."
